# healthie production environment template.
#
# Copy to deploy/.env (gitignored), edit if the defaults do not suit, then run
# `just bootstrap <host>` — it installs this as /opt/healthie/.env owned
# root:root mode 0600. Root-owned on purpose: systemd reads EnvironmentFile= as
# PID 1 before dropping to User=healthie, so the service user never needs to
# read it. (The other services on the box do not do this; healthie deliberately
# does.) The unit references it without a leading dash, so it MUST exist or the
# service refuses to start rather than starting half-configured.
#
# ⚠ VALUES HERE OVERRIDE Environment= IN healthie.service. systemd.exec:
# "Settings from these files override settings made with Environment=" —
# unconditionally, whatever order the directives appear in. And this file is
# written ONCE at bootstrap and is never overwritten by a deploy. So a key set
# here can never afterwards be changed by pushing a new unit; fixing it means
# hand-editing /opt/healthie/.env on the box. Only set a key here if you mean
# it to win permanently.
#
# No secret belongs in this file today. Bearer tokens are argon2-hashed in the
# auth_token table and provisioned with `just token <host> <kind>`, never stored
# in a file. If a secret ever does land here, SINGLE-QUOTE any value containing
# a dollar sign — the env-file loader mangles it otherwise.

# Absolute, and inside the data directory. The unit runs with
# ProtectSystem=strict and ReadWritePaths=/opt/healthie/data, so that is the
# only writable path; a database anywhere else crash-loops the service.
HEALTHIE_DB_PATH=/opt/healthie/data/healthie.db

# 0.0.0.0 keeps the box reachable by raw IP over the VPN, where mDNS `.local`
# names generally do not resolve. Binding loopback-only would put healthie
# behind the reverse proxy alone — a stronger posture, and the hardening to
# take once transport security and off-LAN name resolution are settled:
#   HEALTHIE_LISTEN=127.0.0.1:3005
HEALTHIE_LISTEN=0.0.0.0:3005

# Owned by healthie.service so a redeploy can change them. UNCOMMENTING EITHER
# ONE HERE WINS OVER THE UNIT — permanently, until you hand-edit the copy on the
# box. Leave them commented unless you specifically want to pin a value.
# RUST_LOG=info
# HEALTHIE_MCP_ALLOWED_HOSTS=healthie.local,dietpi.home,dietpi.local,192.168.10.4
